.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0LACRkEeCwcQ7kNvwGV8xmT&_nc_oc=AdrlS3XgO-fjCCYrE9pkNawYHssS5X7R-Xnhw5bRn5AYJvQDYc1t_-48P56C90o_whc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEKZlB0Er6cmmVm1OAK1baTOfRHr9roguwVy67zbBQXYg&oe=6A8047D4"}, "display_name": "Lifesize Plans", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Explore your plans in 3D with the Lifesize plans app. Take your 2D floor plan and transform it into a VR experience that you can walk around and explore in perfect scale. Get a feel for the size and layout of your space and compare different designs side by side. Whether you're an architect, designer, or home builder, the Lifesize plans app will help bring your plans to life.\n\nOur top features:\n\u2022\tFrom 2D to 3D, we can take your plans and turn them into VR walkthroughs\n\u2022\tWalk freely or use the controllers to explore the design\n\u2022\tCompare different designs side by side by switching in the app\n\u2022\t1:1 scale so you can get a true sense of the size and proportions of your space.\nSo why wait? Download the Lifesize plans app today and start exploring your vision in a whole new way! With our app, you can bring your plans to life and get a better understanding of your designs, helping you to create spaces that are functional, beautiful, and truly one-of-a-kind. ", "short_description": "The Lifesize plans app is a must-have for anyone looking to visualize their architectural plans in stunning 3D. With our app, you walk through your plans, getting a feel for the layout and design. Whether you're an architect, designer, or home builder, the Lifesize plans app will help bring your plans to life. So why wait? Download the app today and start exploring your vision in a whole new way!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://envisionvr.net/app-privacy-policy-lifesize-plans/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://envisionvr.net/app-terms-of-use-lifesize-plans/", "publisher_name": "E